    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You know how to set charges to direct a blast in a specific direction or manner. You can shape an explosion caused by <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Explosives\" title=\"Explosives\">Explosives</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mines\" title=\"Mines\">Mines</a> that you set into a line or a cone instead of a radius. The length of the line is equal to 2 x the radius of the explosive <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a>; the length of the cone is equal to 3 x the radius of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a>, and either the line or the cone originates from the square where the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Explosives\" title=\"Explosives\">Explosives</a> are placed.",
